WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.275
Sexual reproduction gives varied offspring; asexual reproduction gives clones.

2
00:00:06.377 --> 00:00:09.752
Two parents, each with two alleles for three genes.

3
00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:18.642
Each offspring gets a random half from each parent, so they vary.

4
00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:24.349
With one parent, the offspring is a clone, exactly the same.
